<title>USA: Brinker FY '97 Q2 shr $0.15 vs loss $0.18.</title>
<headline>Brinker FY '97 Q2 shr $0.15 vs loss $0.18.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				   13 Weeks Ended  26 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>				Dec. 25,   Dec. 27, Dec. 25, Dec. 27,</p>
<p>				    1996	 1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Revs			 $310,925   $289,656 $619,590 $579,116</p>
<p> Net (Loss)		   11,645   (13,553)   28,025    2,026</p>
<p>Primary Net Income</p>
<p>  (Loss) Per Share	    0.15     (0.18)     0.35     0.03</p>
