<p>NOTE: Excluding restructuring related items recorded in fiscal 1996, net income decreased 9.9 percent to $11.6 million from $12.9 million and primary net income per share dropped 11.8 percent to $0.15 from $0.17, compared with the same quarter in fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Brinker International Inc.</p>
